<mxCell id="c70" value="1  Shopper traffic hits the edge (CDN + WAF), then a regional load balancer.     2  Services run as pods in a managed Kubernetes cluster.     3  Reads come from cache, search and the cart store.&lt;br&gt;4  Checkout writes the order to the relational database and publishes an event.     5  Functions send emails, invoices and stock updates from the queue, outside the shopper's request." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#3C4043;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1032" width="1440" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
</mxfile>
